{"tool_name":"nanofeatures","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>MATLAB app to characterize nanoparticles imaged with super-resolution microscopy. nanoFeatures will read text and csv files from the NIKON and ONI microscopes and from the ThunderSTORM Fiji plugin, then cluster the localizations and filter by size and sphericity and finally output nanoparticle features like size, aspect ratio, and number of localizations per cluster (total and for each channel).</p>","summary":"","value":"<p dir=\"auto\">MATLAB app to characterize nanoparticles imaged with super-resolution microscopy. nanoFeatures will read text and csv files from the NIKON and ONI microscopes and from the ThunderSTORM Fiji plugin, then cluster the localizations and filter by size and sphericity and finally output nanoparticle features like size, aspect ratio, and number of localizations per cluster (total and for each channel).</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-24T15:34:04+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-24T11:15:35+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1684926953,"last_comment_uid":19,"status":2}],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1684926953,"last_comment_uid":19,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Cristina Izquierdo-Lozano orcid.org/0000-0003-0917-8860"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5112,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ed8f7a12-332e-4a8b-95a6-56a2d55db6ad","url":"/taxonomy/term/5112"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":3931,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"af7e2903-01ea-4b58-af0f-5aa7522e504d","url":"/user/3931"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4075,"target_type":"taxonomy_term